			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761910201,
					"content": "三番五次提醒你，讓你招子放亮點，這壓箱底的尖貨可是至冬堡的熟客點名要的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾霍瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910202,
					"content": "得，你倒好，到我手下改吃素了還是怎麼？突然就善心大發，給牠放生了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾霍瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910203,
					"content": "大哥，你聽我解釋，這真怨不得我，是那丘丘人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "耶洛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910204,
					"content": "丘丘人？虧你還好意思說呢！咱們盜寶團的招牌都要砸你手裡了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾霍瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910205,
					"content": "打不過啊，大哥，真打不過！它們那一個藍的一個綠的下手比債務處理人還狠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "耶洛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910206,
					"content": "（這兩個傢伙看起來就是走私販了…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910207,
					"content": "…誰在那裡？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾霍瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910208,
					"content": "哎呀露米！還沒到出場的時候！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910209,
					"content": "這是個什麼玩意…看起來很稀罕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾霍瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910210,
					"content": "喂，小姑娘你總應付得來了吧？我看這貨也夠尖，就拿它替了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾霍瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910211,
					"content": "是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "耶洛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910212,
					"content": "居然還想打露米的主意！盜寶團的名聲就是被你們這種人敗壞的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910213,
					"content": "呃，盜寶團有什麼名聲？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761910214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "耶洛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761910214,
					"content": "少跟她廢話！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "艾霍瑪"
				}
			]
		},
